WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.543 --> 00:00:09.177
into CNN.

00:00:09.311 --> 00:00:10.846
The Russians now accusing

00:00:10.979 --> 00:00:14.249
Ukraine of trying to assassinate

00:00:14.382 --> 00:00:14.749
president Putin.

00:00:14.883 --> 00:00:17.319
The Kremlin says that two

00:00:17.752 --> 00:00:18.253
Ukrainian drones were flown

00:00:18.386 --> 00:00:19.855
towards the Kremlin last night.

00:00:20.088 --> 00:00:21.756
A statement released moments

00:00:21.756 --> 00:00:23.124
ago, they say, quote, we regard

00:00:23.258 --> 00:00:24.993
these actions as a planned

00:00:25.126 --> 00:00:26.461
terrorist act an attempt on the

00:00:26.595 --> 00:00:27.295
president's life.

00:00:27.429 --> 00:00:29.097
It also says Russia reserves the

00:00:29.231 --> 00:00:34.069
right to take retolltory

00:00:34.202 --> 00:00:36.171
measures where and when sees

00:00:36.304 --> 00:00:36.438
fit.

00:00:36.571 --> 00:00:37.772
Putin was not in the Kremlin at

00:00:37.873 --> 00:00:40.675
the time this happened.

00:00:40.809 --> 00:00:42.143
Nic Robertson is live in eastern

00:00:42.277 --> 00:00:43.111
Ukraine with this breaking news.

00:00:43.245 --> 00:00:45.780
What are we learning?

00:00:45.881 --> 00:00:46.481
This is coming from the Kremlin.

00:00:46.615 --> 00:00:47.782
If you take everything they say

00:00:47.782 --> 00:00:49.217
with a grain of salt.

00:00:49.351 --> 00:00:53.054
What are you learned about this?

00:00:53.188 --> 00:00:53.822
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Yeah, really has to

00:00:53.955 --> 00:00:56.825
be taken with a lot of concern

00:00:56.958 --> 00:00:59.794
and treated with the fact that

00:00:59.794 --> 00:01:04.032
we know that the Kremlin often

00:01:04.165 --> 00:01:04.633
lie about the situation.

00:01:04.766 --> 00:01:05.367
What we know is what the Kremlin

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.336
tells their population often

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:10.472
sticks with the population that

00:01:10.605 --> 00:01:11.873
Russians will most often believe

00:01:12.007 --> 00:01:12.507
what they are told by the

00:01:12.641 --> 00:01:12.841
Kremlin.

00:01:12.974 --> 00:01:13.808
That's another reason to take

00:01:13.808 --> 00:01:15.210
this seriously because is this

00:01:15.343 --> 00:01:17.078
an effort by Putin to try to

00:01:17.212 --> 00:01:18.847
find some way to escalate or

00:01:18.980 --> 00:01:20.982
again justify his war in

00:01:21.116 --> 00:01:21.416
Ukraine.

00:01:21.816 --> 00:01:23.184
What do we know at the moment?

00:01:23.318 --> 00:01:24.953
We know that state media

00:01:25.086 --> 00:01:26.321
reported that two Ukrainian

00:01:26.454 --> 00:01:28.924
uavs, unmanned aerial vehicles,

00:01:29.057 --> 00:01:30.292
were flown towards the Kremlin,

00:01:30.425 --> 00:01:32.127
that they were intercepted,

00:01:32.260 --> 00:01:33.828
disabled, that the debris that

00:01:33.862 --> 00:01:36.731
fell from them didn't cause any

00:01:36.865 --> 00:01:37.399
injuries inside the Kremlin.

00:01:37.832 --> 00:01:38.967
After that, the Kremlin then

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:42.203
said this was an attack, attempt

00:01:42.337 --> 00:01:43.405
on president Putin's life.

00:01:43.838 --> 00:01:45.206
As you said, we know that Putin

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:46.508
wasn't there inside the Kremlin

00:01:46.641 --> 00:01:48.076
at the time.

00:01:48.209 --> 00:01:51.846
There are social media videos of

00:01:51.846 --> 00:01:52.180
what purports to be this

00:01:52.314 --> 00:01:53.415
incident, but again this

00:01:53.848 --> 00:01:54.783
requires absolute scrutiny and

00:01:54.916 --> 00:01:57.852
CNN at this time cannot verify.

00:01:57.953 --> 00:01:58.887
Eyewitnesses about the time that

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:02.624
this event is allegedly supposed

00:02:02.757 --> 00:02:04.359
to have taken place do report

00:02:04.492 --> 00:02:06.061
hearing at least one loud clap

00:02:06.194 --> 00:02:08.964
or small explosion in the area.

00:02:09.097 --> 00:02:12.367
But at the moment Ukrainians

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:13.401
haven't said anything officially

00:02:13.535 --> 00:02:15.236
about it, but it is clear that

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.205
for Ukraine this would be a

00:02:17.339 --> 00:02:19.507
concern about how Russia will

00:02:19.874 --> 00:02:20.942
respond and use this information

00:02:21.076 --> 00:02:22.877
that they are putting out in the

00:02:23.011 --> 00:02:24.879
population, what more do we know

00:02:25.013 --> 00:02:25.413
about these drones.

00:02:25.547 --> 00:02:28.283
We do know that Ukraine does

00:02:28.416 --> 00:02:31.386
have longer distance drones than

00:02:31.519 --> 00:02:33.054
it did in the past.

00:02:33.188 --> 00:02:34.556
They threaten the Kremlin in

00:02:34.689 --> 00:02:36.358
this way -- [ inaudible ] We

00:02:36.491 --> 00:02:39.995
need to pay very close attention

00:02:40.128 --> 00:02:42.998
to -- close scrutiny of this

00:02:43.131 --> 00:02:43.331
video.

00:02:43.465 --> 00:02:44.866
&gt;&gt; And it is important to note

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.837
that we have seen Russian allege

00:02:48.970 --> 00:02:49.537
things in the past to justify

00:02:49.904 --> 00:02:52.173
its own actions.

00:02:52.307 --> 00:02:53.475
You said we have not heard

00:02:53.908 --> 00:02:54.409
anything from the Ukrainian side

00:02:54.542 --> 00:02:57.312
on this?

00:02:57.445 --> 00:02:59.214
&gt;&gt; Reporter: Correct.

00:02:59.347 --> 00:03:00.915
False flag operations have been

00:03:01.049 --> 00:03:02.684
the modus operandi, the playbook

00:03:02.817 --> 00:03:03.418
of the Kremlin.

00:03:03.551 --> 00:03:03.918
Absolutely.

00:03:03.952 --> 00:03:06.521
They want to do this sort of

00:03:06.655 --> 00:03:09.457
thing to use it as propaganda as

00:03:09.591 --> 00:03:10.925
they have in the past for events

00:03:11.059 --> 00:03:12.460
that are yet to unfold.

00:03:12.594 --> 00:03:13.928
We know that Russia is concerned

00:03:13.928 --> 00:03:16.665
about a potential Ukrainian

00:03:16.798 --> 00:03:17.165
counteroffensive.

00:03:17.298 --> 00:03:19.934
We know that they are -- that

00:03:19.934 --> 00:03:20.802
Russians are losing troops at

00:03:20.935 --> 00:03:25.340
the front line in high numbers.

00:03:25.473 --> 00:03:27.375
Troops fight in those front

00:03:27.509 --> 00:03:29.044
lines today, and, you know, they

00:03:29.177 --> 00:03:31.212
talk about the intensity of the

00:03:31.346 --> 00:03:32.781
fight, the expectations and the

00:03:32.914 --> 00:03:34.416
training they get for the battle

00:03:34.549 --> 00:03:35.216
ahead of them.

00:03:35.350 --> 00:03:37.452
So the expectation on the ground

00:03:37.585 --> 00:03:39.054
all along the front lines in

00:03:39.187 --> 00:03:40.021
Ukraine is that the fighting

00:03:40.155 --> 00:03:42.957
here is going to heat up.

00:03:43.091 --> 00:03:44.459
What we have also seen in recent

00:03:44.592 --> 00:03:47.962
days, and I think this is very

00:03:47.962 --> 00:03:49.197
significant and very important,

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:51.032
we have seen two Russian trains

00:03:51.166 --> 00:03:52.701
just inside Russia north outside

00:03:52.834 --> 00:03:54.469
over the border from Ukraine,

00:03:54.602 --> 00:03:55.570
inside Russia, struck earlier

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:56.638
this week.

00:03:56.771 --> 00:04:00.341
We have seen oil depots struck

00:04:00.475 --> 00:04:00.909
deep in Russia south.

00:04:01.042 --> 00:04:02.110
Not inside Ukraine.

00:04:02.243 --> 00:04:04.846
So it appears as if Russia is

00:04:04.979 --> 00:04:08.717
getting targeted inside Russia,

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.386
not clearly by whom, on vital

00:04:11.519 --> 00:04:14.589
supply lines, the train links,

00:04:14.723 --> 00:04:15.990
and fuel stores.

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:18.760
So is the tempo of activity over

00:04:18.893 --> 00:04:20.795
the border inside Russia heating

00:04:20.929 --> 00:04:21.429
up?

00:04:21.563 --> 00:04:22.764
Who is perpetrating it?

00:04:22.897 --> 00:04:25.500
We don't know:the events over

00:04:25.633 --> 00:04:28.303
the Kremlin, Russian propaganda

00:04:28.436 --> 00:04:32.006
or real events, it's unclear at

00:04:32.006 --> 00:04:32.273
the moment.

00:04:32.407 --> 00:04:33.007
&gt;&gt; If you hear anything, please

00:04:33.141 --> 00:04:34.409
keep us updated.

00:04:34.542 --> 00:04:38.012
&gt;&gt;&gt; Let's bring in retired

00:04:38.046 --> 00:04:38.613
lieutenant colonel Alexander

00:04:38.747 --> 00:04:40.014
vindman, the former European

00:04:40.014 --> 00:04:42.517
affairs director at the national

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:43.017
security council.

00:04:43.151 --> 00:04:45.353
He served as trump's top expert.

00:04:45.487 --> 00:04:48.623
You are the perfect news to have

00:04:48.757 --> 00:04:50.024
on this news.

00:04:50.024 --> 00:04:52.160
How would you expect this?

00:04:52.293 --> 00:04:54.229
Even if it is Russian

00:04:54.362 --> 00:04:57.098
propaganda, how would you expect

00:04:57.232 --> 00:04:59.200
this to cause Russia to act

00:04:59.334 --> 00:05:00.135
towards Ukraine?

00:05:00.268 --> 00:05:02.170
What would retaliation look like

00:05:02.303 --> 00:05:04.038
and how would you be advising

00:05:04.139 --> 00:05:04.739
the administration if you were

00:05:04.873 --> 00:05:06.474
still doing that?

00:05:06.608 --> 00:05:07.408
&gt;&gt; Sure.

00:05:07.542 --> 00:05:09.144
So the first thing is, we could

00:05:09.277 --> 00:05:10.812
set aside that at one

00:05:10.945 --> 00:05:12.113
possibility is that this is a

00:05:12.247 --> 00:05:14.315
pretext for the Russians to

00:05:14.449 --> 00:05:16.217
target zelenskyy as they have

00:05:16.351 --> 00:05:18.052
periodically throughout the war,

00:05:18.052 --> 00:05:20.054
especially early on, for

00:05:20.054 --> 00:05:20.355
assassination.

00:05:20.488 --> 00:05:22.423
It's a pretext saying this is a

00:05:22.557 --> 00:05:24.092
response to a Ukrainian tack.

00:05:24.225 --> 00:05:26.060
More than likely, it's probably

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:28.062
a shaping operation.

00:05:28.062 --> 00:05:30.498
We have seen long range attacks.

00:05:30.632 --> 00:05:34.068
Ukrainians have indijnized

00:05:34.068 --> 00:05:35.303
unmanned combat aerial

00:05:35.436 --> 00:05:36.638
capability and struck out

00:05:36.771 --> 00:05:38.072
against targets on the Russian

00:05:38.072 --> 00:05:39.641
side of the border deep into

00:05:40.074 --> 00:05:40.108
Ukraine.

00:05:40.108 --> 00:05:41.176
This is a demonstration of

00:05:41.309 --> 00:05:42.744
capability, you know, hundreds

00:05:42.877 --> 00:05:44.245
of kilometers.

00:05:44.379 --> 00:05:46.881
600 plus kilometers to Moscow

00:05:47.015 --> 00:05:49.184
and they went after what's

00:05:49.317 --> 00:05:50.652
probably a strategic messaging

00:05:50.785 --> 00:05:52.153
target, which is the Kremlin

00:05:52.287 --> 00:05:54.656
itself, that the Kremlin is

00:05:54.789 --> 00:05:56.090
vulnerable, that we were able to

00:05:56.224 --> 00:05:59.194
launch uavs that got that close

00:05:59.327 --> 00:06:00.495
to the Kremlin, the videos that

00:06:00.628 --> 00:06:03.331
are on media show fire burning

00:06:03.464 --> 00:06:05.033
on one of the chapels in the

00:06:05.166 --> 00:06:06.668
Kremlin itself.

00:06:06.801 --> 00:06:08.336
That's a pretty powerful

00:06:08.469 --> 00:06:09.671
demonstration and something

00:06:10.104 --> 00:06:11.539
intended to send a signal to the

00:06:11.673 --> 00:06:12.974
Russians that they are no longer

00:06:13.107 --> 00:06:15.743
safe at home either.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:18.112
And the Ukrainians land blows in

00:06:18.112 --> 00:06:18.847
this counteroffensive in the

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:20.882
coming weeks and months, this is

00:06:21.015 --> 00:06:22.784
also going to show there is a

00:06:22.917 --> 00:06:24.385
cost directly to the Russian pop

00:06:24.519 --> 00:06:24.652
six.

00:06:24.786 --> 00:06:27.322
I think it's part of a shaping

00:06:27.455 --> 00:06:29.357
operation rather than pretext,

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:30.592
but could be a pretext.

00:06:30.725 --> 00:06:32.126
&gt;&gt; It speaks to what Nick

00:06:32.126 --> 00:06:33.294
reported at the end of his

00:06:33.428 --> 00:06:35.430
report that Russia is getting

00:06:35.563 --> 00:06:36.231
targeted inside Russia, deeper

00:06:36.364 --> 00:06:40.435
inside Russia, unclear by whom.

00:06:40.568 --> 00:06:42.270
&gt;&gt; That's definitely -- I mean,

00:06:42.403 --> 00:06:42.971
it's pretty clear.

00:06:43.104 --> 00:06:44.339
The thing is that the Ukrainians

00:06:44.472 --> 00:06:46.808
have gone to a policy and kind

00:06:46.941 --> 00:06:49.510
of an Israeli policy of

00:06:49.644 --> 00:06:50.712
non-attribution or not taking

00:06:50.845 --> 00:06:52.146
credit for these attacks.

00:06:52.146 --> 00:06:54.148
But in fact it's pretty clear

00:06:54.182 --> 00:06:55.316
logically who is conducting

00:06:55.450 --> 00:06:56.684
these attacks.

00:06:56.818 --> 00:06:59.420
It's the Ukrainian armed forces

00:06:59.554 --> 00:07:02.490
attempting to set conditions to

00:07:02.624 --> 00:07:05.059
liberate their territory, free

00:07:05.193 --> 00:07:06.327
their people from Russian

00:07:06.461 --> 00:07:06.728
occupation.

00:07:06.861 --> 00:07:08.363
These are minor events unfold

00:07:08.496 --> 00:07:10.598
going in a precursor to a major

00:07:10.732 --> 00:07:12.400
strike by Ukrainian armed forces

00:07:12.533 --> 00:07:14.969
that will achieve broad effects,

00:07:15.236 --> 00:07:15.436
I think.

00:07:15.570 --> 00:07:16.571
We are not going to see the war

00:07:16.704 --> 00:07:18.706
end in the next five, six

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:19.807
months, but the Ukrainians are

00:07:20.174 --> 00:07:21.709
going to achieve some major

00:07:21.843 --> 00:07:22.176
gains.

00:07:22.176 --> 00:07:23.645
I am not a schedule particular

00:07:23.778 --> 00:07:24.212
here.

00:07:24.345 --> 00:07:25.280
I believe what I see with my

00:07:25.413 --> 00:07:28.716
eyes that the Ukrainians have

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:29.450
demonstrated capability to lab

00:07:29.584 --> 00:07:34.188
rate territory, they are going

00:07:34.322 --> 00:07:35.256
to put normal pressure on vp to

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:35.757
put up or shut up.

00:07:36.190 --> 00:07:37.525
Put up doing another

00:07:37.659 --> 00:07:38.726
mobilization pulling in hundreds

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:40.194
of thousands of troops or start

00:07:40.261 --> 00:07:41.863
to put his toes into

00:07:42.196 --> 00:07:42.597
negotiations which is the more

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.666
likely course of action.

00:07:44.799 --> 00:07:46.267
&gt;&gt; So, obviously, we take

00:07:46.401 --> 00:07:47.235
everything Russia says with a

00:07:47.368 --> 00:07:48.469
grain of salt given how much

00:07:48.603 --> 00:07:49.070
they lie.

00:07:49.203 --> 00:07:50.305
About you do you think that

00:07:50.438 --> 00:07:52.373
there is a real chance here that

00:07:52.507 --> 00:07:54.208
this is what Ukraine was trying

00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:57.178
to do, that it was an attempt on

00:07:57.312 --> 00:07:57.612
Putin's life?

00:07:57.745 --> 00:08:00.214
&gt;&gt; I don't think it's an attempt

00:08:00.348 --> 00:08:00.982
on Putin's life.

00:08:01.115 --> 00:08:03.651
The Ukrainians probably better

00:08:03.785 --> 00:08:04.385
than anybody else know the

00:08:04.519 --> 00:08:05.687
patterns of life for Vladimir

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:06.220
Putin.

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:10.858
He is un -- it's pretty evident

00:08:10.992 --> 00:08:12.226
there are massive motorcades

00:08:12.226 --> 00:08:13.795
that lock up the city of Moscow

00:08:14.228 --> 00:08:14.996
when he is traveling there.

00:08:15.129 --> 00:08:16.230
They were confident that he

00:08:16.331 --> 00:08:18.266
wasn't going to be in the

00:08:18.399 --> 00:08:20.368
Kremlin and it was more of a --

00:08:20.501 --> 00:08:23.304
again, a strategic strike on

00:08:23.438 --> 00:08:25.807
kind of the heart of our --

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:26.908
Russia's power, the Kremlin

00:08:27.041 --> 00:08:28.443
itself, with a demonstration

00:08:28.576 --> 00:08:32.246
that that even that location is

00:08:32.246 --> 00:08:32.347
not safe.

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:34.615
So unlikely an assassination,

00:08:34.749 --> 00:08:36.451
more likely a demonstration of

00:08:36.584 --> 00:08:39.187
ability and cost.

00:08:39.320 --> 00:08:39.821
&gt;&gt; Could we ask you about

00:08:40.254 --> 00:08:40.488
president zelenskyy in this

00:08:40.621 --> 00:08:41.622
interview with "The Washington

00:08:41.756 --> 00:08:42.490
post" yesterday saying you just

00:08:42.623 --> 00:08:44.258
said that you do believe Ukraine

00:08:44.258 --> 00:08:46.294
will be able to make territorial

00:08:46.427 --> 00:08:47.829
gains in the spring offensive.

00:08:48.262 --> 00:08:50.932
There were documents that were

00:08:51.065 --> 00:08:51.866
leaked online that the white

00:08:52.266 --> 00:08:54.936
house is disputing how authentic

00:08:55.069 --> 00:08:56.671
they are, but they seem to say

00:08:56.804 --> 00:08:58.773
that actually behind closed

00:08:58.906 --> 00:09:00.608
doors there is skepticism in the

00:09:00.742 --> 00:09:03.411
administration of what Ukraine

00:09:03.544 --> 00:09:04.379
will be able to achieve when it

00:09:04.512 --> 00:09:05.813
comes to retaking land.

00:09:05.947 --> 00:09:08.316
What do you make of the fact

00:09:08.449 --> 00:09:10.284
that they hasn't spoke to

00:09:10.284 --> 00:09:10.885
zelenskyy about that leak?

00:09:11.019 --> 00:09:13.154
&gt;&gt; Start with the premise that

00:09:13.287 --> 00:09:14.555
our analysis has been

00:09:14.689 --> 00:09:17.458
consistently wrong in

00:09:17.592 --> 00:09:18.526
underestimating Ukrainian power

00:09:18.659 --> 00:09:21.129
and overestimated Russia power.

00:09:21.262 --> 00:09:22.797
Half of that analysis is those

00:09:22.930 --> 00:09:24.365
leaked reports is inaccurate.

00:09:24.499 --> 00:09:25.500
It's just a fact.

00:09:25.633 --> 00:09:27.702
In terms of the kind of raw

00:09:27.835 --> 00:09:29.937
damage from these leaks, it's

00:09:30.304 --> 00:09:30.371
quite minimal.

00:09:30.505 --> 00:09:31.939
The bigger damage comes from the

00:09:32.306 --> 00:09:35.410
fact that we've continued to

00:09:35.543 --> 00:09:36.511
undermine our standing with

00:09:36.644 --> 00:09:37.245
these leaks.

00:09:37.378 --> 00:09:39.147
Our other allies are going to be

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:40.314
dubious about sharing

00:09:40.381 --> 00:09:41.649
information with us.

00:09:41.783 --> 00:09:43.618
This validates the fact that the

00:09:43.751 --> 00:09:45.486
Ukrainians were reluctant to

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:48.322
share information and

00:09:48.322 --> 00:09:48.823
intelligence with the U.S.

00:09:48.956 --> 00:09:49.557
Throughout the war, especially

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:50.324
early on.

00:09:50.358 --> 00:09:52.360
They started getting a level of

00:09:52.493 --> 00:09:52.760
confidence.

00:09:52.894 --> 00:09:53.361
President zelenskyy in

00:09:53.494 --> 00:09:55.396
