Trump released a transcript that

00:09:57.098 --> 00:09:58.866
was embarrassing to zelenskyy.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.334
That is really not the way we

00:10:00.334 --> 00:10:02.470
are supposed to interact with

00:10:02.603 --> 00:10:03.571
allies and partners.

00:10:03.704 --> 00:10:05.506
The problem is there are

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:06.908
