00:10:18.519 --> 00:10:20.354
Lesser powers don't get the same

00:10:20.354 --> 00:10:20.555
conversation.

00:10:20.688 --> 00:10:22.557
So zelenskyy's already

00:10:22.690 --> 00:10:22.924
skeptical.

00:10:23.057 --> 00:10:24.358
We need to do better about

00:10:24.392 --> 00:10:26.994
coordinating with allies.

00:10:27.128 --> 00:10:27.762
We need to treat them

00:10:27.895 --> 00:10:30.565
accordingly, especially now that

00:10:30.698 --> 00:10:33.067
Ukraine has demonstrated as

00:10:33.201 --> 00:10:35.636
probably the most partner in

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:36.370
that part of the world and,

00:10:36.437 --> 00:10:42.009
hopefully, we learn and be more

